                <p>For Sir L. West to Mr. Bayard, March 19, 1888, see Doc. No. 561, post, <ref
                        target="#pg792">page 792</ref>. For Mr. Bayard to Sir L. West, March 21,
                    1888, see Doc. No. 563, post, <ref target="#pg793">page 793</ref>, For Sir L.
                    West to Mr. Bayard, January 14, 1888, see Doc. No. 549, post, <ref
                        target="#pg775">page 775</ref>.</p>
                <p>For memorandum of Sir L. West, received March 7, 1888, see Doc. No. 557, post,
                        <ref target="#pg789">page 789</ref>.</p>
